  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Lock after the idempotency pre-check",
      "items": [
        "Two concurrent first uses of one key can both miss the pre-lock read",
        "The second is refused 409 by the database's own unique index on (CallingSystem, IdempotencyKey), not silently double-posted"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "What this can't show",
      "items": [
        "The per-account lock is single-process, in-memory — correct for one instance, not a horizontally-scaled deployment",
        "The account's own status-gate and floor rules are Accounts' domain logic, applied here through TryApplyPosting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Checks and outcomes",
      "items": [
        "valid: Refused otherwise: 422 UNSUPPORTED_CURRENCY / INVALID_POSTING_AMOUNT / EFFECTIVE_DATE_IN_FUTURE",
        "none — proceed: Same key + same content replays with 200. Same key + different content: 409. No key skips this check.",
        "AcquireAsync(accountId, 10s): Times out: 422 LOCK_TIMEOUT, nothing recorded",
        "found: Otherwise: 404, account not found",
        "match: Refused otherwise: 422 CURRENCY_MISMATCH",
        "TryApplyPosting(direction, amount, effectiveDate): Status gate + floor check — see Accounts' status/floor rules",
        "signedValue, balanceAfter, streamPosition: Refused otherwise: 422 ACCOUNT_CLOSED / ACCOUNT_FROZEN / ACCOUNT_DORMANT_DEBIT_REFUSED / INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS / AMOUNT_OUT_OF_RANGE"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Checks in the handler and account",
      "items": [
        "RecordPostingCommandHandler validates amount and date, then compares posting currency with the loaded account",
        "Account.TryApplyPosting applies the status gate, amount ceiling and floor before SaveChangesAsync",
        "The save updates acc.Accounts and inserts acc.Postings; the selected database also stores the outbox row when messaging is enabled"
      ]
    }
  ]
